00:03:52.310 --> 00:03:57.550
This is truly a fearsome Hundred Tales! Far scarier than telling ghost stories!

00:03:57.820 --> 00:04:00.150
What makes them so fearsome...

00:04:00.420 --> 00:04:02.550
