Let's go over the basics again.

00:18:30.530 --> 00:18:32.440
Do you make matching varsity jackets?

00:18:33.030 --> 00:18:36.240
If we have matching helmets and slogans, let's prepare them.

00:18:36.240 --> 00:18:38.850
And this is our rulebook.

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:38.830
Meine Kampfzeit

00:18:40.710 --> 00:18:41.700
Goodbye.

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:46.520
I was joking. There's no sport called <i>negati</i> like you were saying.

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:50.910
If you're not a clu<i>b</i> that does <i>negati</i>, what kind of club are you?

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:54.910
Uhh, it's the “negative” from “positive” and “negative”.

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:55.880
Positive

00:18:52.180 --> 00:18:55.880
Negative

00:18:54.910 --> 00:18:59.520
Oh, it's a contraction of “negative” and “club”!

00:18:55.550 --> 00:18:59.520
Negative clu<u>b</u>

00:18:59.520 --> 00:19:05.120
Explaining the gag? You really are good at looking backwards at things.

00:19:05.120 --> 00:19:08.260
So... You aren't going to give me chic eyeglasses?

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:09.630
Oh, right, right.

00:19:13.770 --> 00:19:16.130
Congrats on joining!

00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:18.040
You think I can wear these!?

00:19:18.480 --> 00:19:19.800
It's not even that year!

00:19:19.800 --> 00:19:20.640
<i>That's</i> your problem?

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:22.810
Then how about those?

00:19:24.040 --> 00:19:25.830
These are perfect!

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:28.040
Why don't you try saying something fitting?

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:30.550
“Youth!” ...or something.

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:34.750
The glasses are tightening!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.960
constricting headband

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.960
Son Goku

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:37.960
Priest Sanzo

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:37.960
They're made of the same material as Son Goku's constricting headband.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:40.590
They're the conflicting glasses!

00:19:42.430 --> 00:19:43.360
Conflicting?

00:19:43.600 --> 00:19:48.870
Yes. If you think something even a little positive, the conflicting glasses will constrict your temples.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:50.510
Th–They won't come off!

00:19:54.010 --> 00:19:55.010
All right.

00:19:55.010 --> 00:19:56.940
As a newcomer, let's start with greetings.

00:19:58.280 --> 00:19:59.740
“Good morning!”

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:02.550
That's no greeting!

00:20:02.550 --> 00:20:04.670
This is how you greet someone!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:08.000
Good morning.

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.970
The basic greeting is prostration.

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:12.720
Is this some kind of high-class Japanese restaurant?

00:20:12.720 --> 00:20:15.980
Isn't prostration more for apology than greeting, anyway?

00:20:16.960 --> 00:20:19.130
This is how you apologize.

00:20:19.130 --> 00:20:20.470
Understood!

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:25.370
The flattening of your hands,

00:20:25.620 --> 00:20:26.370
the form of your lap,

00:20:26.700 --> 00:20:27.470
the atmosphere of patheticness.

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:29.170
They're all perfect.

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:31.850
For a freshman to be able to do this...

00:20:31.850 --> 00:20:32.660
Impressive.

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:35.430
Stop joking around with these negative club activities!

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:36.450
Let me leave!

00:20:36.690 --> 00:20:39.420
I want to live a positive school life!

00:20:42.460 --> 00:20:43.890
Positive?

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.030
Episode 1975

00:20:46.930 --> 00:20:48.030
Collapse of the Bubble

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:51.900
This is what happens when the entire populace is enthusiastically positive!

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.900
(1) Rush to join the Japanese F1 planning committee -> rush of resignations after the bubble burst
(2) Increasing employment -> Extreme drop in applicants
(3) Huge drop in real estate and stock prices -> widespread bank failure

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.900
(4) One-length bob -> Sexy clothes
(5) The baby boom -> ag***

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.900
(6) Pressure-free education -> pressure-free
(7) Buy without visiting the property -> it's on a cliff

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.900
(8) Planning rush -> asbestos

00:20:48.860 --> 00:20:51.900
(9) ODA -> Into the pockets of high officials
(10) OAD -> only Kodansha wins -> overprinting -> overstock
(11) 17 years of effort
-> animated adaption
-> public humiliation

00:20:52.220 --> 00:20:54.350
So many ended up unemployed,

00:20:54.350 --> 00:20:56.870
and so many bosses took a one-way trip to see the gorges!

00:20:57.250 --> 00:21:02.610
You don't even know what may happen in the future to the enthusiastic Tetsuya Komuro you listen to now.

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:08.450
If there had only been a few more people capable of negative thinking, maybe we could have avoided the bubble.

00:21:08.450 --> 00:21:13.770
What we need now are people who can grasp things in a negative fashion!

00:21:13.770 --> 00:21:15.220
It'll look great on your résumé.

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:16.380
But...

00:21:16.380 --> 00:21:19.320
I can't live just looking back!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:23.050
Just why do you want me in your club so badly?

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:26.130
You have a special talent for looking backward!

00:21:27.300 --> 00:21:29.870
I-I'm not any good at that!

00:21:29.870 --> 00:21:30.700
Hold on!

00:21:30.700 --> 00:21:34.770
If you leave during your probationary period, won't that make you a parolee?

00:21:39.040 --> 00:21:40.560
A parolee?

00:21:40.560 --> 00:21:43.420
A parolee, unforgivable for even the smallest violations!?

00:21:43.650 --> 00:21:45.380
It'll be tough.

00:21:58.830 --> 00:21:59.870
An

00:21:58.860 --> 00:22:00.870
Owwie!

00:22:01.100 --> 00:22:03.590
Assaulting a little girl while on parole...!

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:05.570
It's over. My life is over.

00:22:06.360 --> 00:22:09.340
I lost my way on a field trip!

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:11.730
It'll be a problem if you stay lost.

00:22:11.730 --> 00:22:12.880
Let's get you to the police.

00:22:13.240 --> 00:22:15.310
We can call them from that house.

00:22:22.250 --> 00:22:25.120
You guys again! Didn't I say I wasn't going to join!?

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:31.130
Young girl
kidnapped

00:22:25.120 --> 00:22:31.130
Seeking
Information

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:28.030
A girl who went on a field trip appears to have been kidnapped.

00:22:28.480 --> 00:22:31.130
The culprit is wearing this variety of glasses.

00:22:32.960 --> 00:22:34.350
You—!

00:22:34.790 --> 00:22:39.350
We may be drains on society too, but kidnapping a little girl is just inhuman!

00:22:39.350 --> 00:22:39.970
Heretic!

00:22:39.970 --> 00:22:45.110
This is one of the distortions of society given form by laissez-faire capitalism!

00:22:45.110 --> 00:22:46.610
Purge time!

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:47.610
Purge him!

00:22:47.610 --> 00:22:53.900
Purge! Purge! Purge! Purge!

00:23:02.050 --> 00:23:03.930
Good morning, Itoshiki-kun!

00:23:04.800 --> 00:23:06.710
Good morning.

00:23:06.710 --> 00:23:08.030
What... what...!

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:10.380
How disgusting!

00:23:24.780 --> 00:23:30.110
aka no shuraba wo kakenukeru
Tear through the red carnage.

00:23:30.890 --> 00:23:36.480
machi ni sumitsuku shoujotachi
There are girls who settle in this town.

00:23:36.940 --> 00:23:41.690
saraitai nara sureba ii
It's okay if you want to run off with them.

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:48.090
sonna no zenzen kowaku wa nai wa
That doesn't frighten me at all.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:51.640
amazuppai you na kanjou
My bittersweetish emotions

00:23:52.060 --> 00:23:55.150
tsubure chatteta zakuro mitai
resemble crushed pomegranates.

00:23:55.150 --> 00:24:00.040
warui koto wa sore ijou nai deshou
Things can't get worse than that, right?

00:24:01.290 --> 00:24:07.470
hana wo meshi mase powazon kisu no ato
Summon the flowers. After a poison kiss,

00:24:07.470 --> 00:24:13.040
kibou no toge ga shita ni tsukisasaru
a lawnweed of hope sticks to my tongue.

00:24:13.610 --> 00:24:19.770
koko de shindara shinizon mappira yo
If I die here, absolutely nothing of value would be lost.

00:24:19.770 --> 00:24:25.610
kono tamashii wa dare ni mo agenai
No one gets to have my soul.

00:24:25.940 --> 00:24:31.800
anata ga oshiete kureta
You taught me that

00:24:32.080 --> 00:24:39.920
zetsubou sore ga omamori yo
despair is my good-luck charm.

